# TMA-Libraries requirements

- Follow the repository-wide instructions in `AGENTS.md`.
- Apply all mandatory standards in `docs/TMAPPS-STANDARDS.md`.
- Preserve application scope in `docs/TMA-LIBRARIES-SPEC.md`.
- Use `docs/DELIVERY-PLAN.md` for delivery order and unresolved dependencies.
- Keep completion claims tied to implemented and verified behaviour.
- Use Leather Brown `#97572B` and a white folder on a brown background.
- No feature may require incurred costs; use a free alternative or defer it.
- Update KB documentation, tours, release notes, performance evidence, and security checks with application changes.
